      "notes": "Add a 'why now' slide naming the specific catalyst: the simultaneous availability of GitHub, Stripe, Vercel, and Linear APIs, the post-COVID explosion of indie SaaS founders, and the gap created by AI coding tools that speed up product work but do nothing about tooling integration overhead."
